# Task 143-005 Execution Plan

## Root Cause
`shouldRun()` checks `docs/reference/health-check.md` (correct path matching `targetFile`),
but `run()` uses `docs/HEALTH-CHECK.md` (wrong path). This mismatch means `run()` never finds
the file even when `shouldRun()` returns true.

## Fix
1. Extract a shared `HEALTH_DOC_PATH` constant = `'docs/reference/health-check.md'`
2. Use `HEALTH_DOC_PATH` in both `shouldRun()` and `run()` to build the full path
3. Add file creation logic in `run()` when file doesn't exist (generate minimal template)
4. Update tests to cover: path consistency, file creation, normal update flow, no-changes case

